Qwen Image reference preprocessing

The independent C implementation in ds4_qwen_image_reference.c follows Pillow
12.3.0 fixed-point Lanczos resampling and RGBA/RGBa conversion conventions:
src/libImaging/Resample.c and src/libImaging/Convert.c.
